# The Legend of Kuruk: chapter III is "Exile this Saga, then return it to the battlefield transformed under YOUR control" - the controller
# of the chapter ability, who need not own the Saga (CR 712.14a, 113.8). Bot1 casts the Saga on turn 1 (chapter I: scry 2 and draw)
# and gives it to Bot2 with Harmless Offering. The lore counters are Bot2's from then on: chapter II on turn 2 is Bot2's scry and
# draw, chapter III on turn 4 returns it as Avatar Kuruk under Bot2's control, though Bot1 owns the card. Bot1's battlefield has no
# Kuruk; Bot2's has a new object with no lore counters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
The Legend of Kuruk
Harmless Offering
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Swamp x4
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

